license: MIT
version: 0.2.0
abstract: >-
  Agent skills in the SKILL.md format for synthesisable Verilog/SystemVerilog,
  testbench discipline, timing closure and clock-domain crossings, OpenLane 2
  on Sky130, Cortex-M firmware and MISRA C, ESP32/M5Stack provisioning, modern
  C++ and GoogleTest, latency-critical systems, and INT8 quantisation to
  TFLite Micro. Every skill ships with usefulness, discovery and adversarial
  discovery evals, and replayable transcripts.
keywords:
